WEBVTT

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:32.344
And it's kind of my favorite
thing in the world.

00:12:32.368 --> 00:12:35.587
And it just began, like, in the beginning
of February. So who knows?

00:12:35.611 --> 00:12:39.118
Again, I don't say it's good,
I just think it's not boring, right?

00:12:39.142 --> 00:12:40.643
And here's the last bit.

00:12:40.667 --> 00:12:43.198
(Music)

00:12:43.594 --> 00:12:47.841
IM: I make buttermilk pancakes
or buttermilk waffles all the time.

00:12:47.865 --> 00:12:49.016
Sara Moulton: Do you?

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:51.684
IM: Yeah, but I can never
find buttermilk, ever.

00:12:51.708 --> 00:12:54.155
You can't find it at Citarella,
you can't find it.

00:12:54.179 --> 00:12:56.096
SM: You can't?
IM: It's always low-fat.

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:58.100
SM: But that's all it is.
IM: It is? OK.

00:12:58.124 --> 00:13:00.976
SM: You don't know?
Let me tell you something interesting.